---
const control =
  'min-h-12 rounded-xl border border-border px-4 py-2 font-bold hover:bg-elevated';
---

<!-- Keep the original header flow height; the button extends its touch/focus box. -->
<span class="relative min-w-0 max-w-[65%] break-words border border-border bg-surface rounded-full px-2 py-1.75 md:px-3 text-base tracking-wide hover:bg-elevated">
  <span id="weather-location-name" class="pointer-events-none">
    <span data-location>Météo · Annecy</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true"> ▾</span>
    <span data-location-scope class="text-xs text-secondary" hidden>
      {' '}
      · Sur cet appareil
    </span>
  </span>
  <button
    type="button"
    data-location-open
    aria-label="Changer le lieu météo"
    aria-describedby="weather-location-name"
    aria-haspopup="dialog"
    class="absolute inset-x-0 -inset-y-1 rounded-full cursor-pointer"
  ></button>
</span>
<dialog
  data-location-dialog
  aria-labelledby="location-title"
  aria-describedby="location-help"
  class="m-auto w-[min(36rem,94vw)] max-h-[90dvh] overflow-y-auto scroll-p-3 rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface text-primary p-6 shadow-xl"
>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <h2 id="location-title" class="text-2xl font-bold">
      Lieu météo
    </h2>
    <button type="button" data-location-close class={control}>
      Fermer
    </button>
  </div>
  <p id="location-help" class="mt-4 text-base text-secondary">
    Ce choix concerne uniquement cet appareil. L’horloge, les rendez-vous et le
    programme de la maison gardent leur fuseau. Les prévisions suivent l’heure
    du lieu choisi.
  </p>
  <p data-location-current class="mt-3 font-bold"></p>
  <form data-location-search class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 p-2">
    <label for="location-search" class="font-bold">
      Ville ou code postal
    </label>
    <input
      id="location-search"
      name="location"
      type="search"
      minlength="2"
      maxlength="100"
      required
      autocomplete="off"
      autofocus
      class="min-h-12 w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-background px-3 py-2 select-text"
    />
    <button type="submit" class={control}>
      Rechercher
    </button>
  </form>
  <p
    data-location-status
    role="status"
    class="mt-3 text-base text-secondary"
  ></p>
  <div
    data-location-results
    class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 p-2"
    role="group"
    aria-label="Résultats de recherche"
  ></div>
  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-4 p-2">
    <button type="button" data-location-geolocate class={control}>
      Utiliser ma position
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-location-reset class={control}>
      Revenir au lieu de la maison
    </button>
    <a
      href="/admin/settings"
      class="min-h-12 flex items-center underline underline-offset-4"
    >
      Modifier le lieu de la maison (administration)
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-secondary">
    Recherche :{' '}
    <a class="underline" href="https://open-meteo.com/">
      Open-Meteo
    </a>{' '}
    · lieux :{' '}
    <a class="underline" href="https://www.geonames.org/">
      GeoNames
    </a>
    . Votre recherche ou votre position est transmise à Open-Meteo uniquement à
    votre demande.
  </p>
</dialog>

<style>
  dialog::backdrop {
    background: #182c3580;
  }
</style>
